# Component Conventions

## Structure
- Reusable UI in `src/components/<PascalCase>.tsx` — only when the user asks for a component
- One-off homepage sections: add inline in `src/app/page.tsx` unless told otherwise
- Default export, typed props interface (`ComponentNameProps`) for shared components
- Pages compose components in `src/app/**/page.tsx`

## Server vs Client
| Use server (default) | Use `"use client"` |
|---------------------|-------------------|
| Static layout, metadata | `useState`, `useEffect`, event handlers |
| Presentational sections | Mobile menus, dropdowns, observers |
| `Button` (no hooks) | `Header`, `HeroSection` |

## Reuse Before Creating
- **Button**: pill CTA — `variant="primary" | "secondary" | "outline"`, optional `href`/`icon`
- **HeroSection**: hero/split layout with heading, highlight, description, dual CTAs, image, optional lead form
- **Header**: sticky nav with services dropdown + Live Chat CTA

## Marketing Sections (build as components)
Hero → value badge + social proof → services → calculator → bestsellers → testimonials → FAQ → footer

## HTML & SEO
- One `<h1>` per page; semantic tags (`<section>`, `<article>`, `<footer>`)
- No nested `<main>` — layout already wraps children in `<main>`
- Per-page `Metadata` export on every `page.tsx`
